  43: ## training/ — GPU jobs on Colab and Modal
  44: 
  45: | Script | Does |
  46: |---|---|
  47: | `jobs/*.json` | **Job configs:** model, dataset revision, steps, LoRA, evals |
  48: | `vm_model_pipeline.sh` | **Runs on the GPU:** train → evaluate → push, each step skipped if already done |
  49: | `vm_train.sh`, `vm_eval.sh`, `vm_train_eval_push.sh`, `vm_logprob_only.sh` | Single stages of the pipeline |
