FILE docs/repository.md
   1: # Repository notes
   2: 
   3: **Contents:** [Layout](#layout) · [2026-11-20 restructure](#2026-11-20-restructure) ·
   4: [Secrets](#secrets-and-history-rewrites) · [Branches and tags](#branches-and-tags)
   5: 
   6: ---
   7: 
   8: ## Layout
   9: 
  10: | Path | What it holds | Edited after the fact? |
  11: |---|---|---|
  12: | `README.md`, `docs/*.md` | Documentation | Yes: kept current |
  13: | `docs/PREREG_v4.md` | Preregistration + dated deviations | **No**: append-only record |
  14: | `docs/research/` | Literature reviews (deep-research reports + notes) | Only dead links repaired |
  15: | `analysis/` | Scripts that compute reported numbers | Yes |
  16: | `train/`, `data/`, `eval/` | Training code, dataset builders, benchmark harnesses | Yes |
  17: | `scripts/` | Run orchestration by purpose ([scripts/README.md](../scripts/README.md)) | Yes |
  18: | `results/` | Raw results and computed summaries ([results/README.md](../results/README.md)) | Summaries are regenerated; raw files are not edited |
  19: | `results/codex/` | Codex audit briefs, reports and evidence | No |
  20: | `logs/` | Run logs kept as evidence ([logs/README.md](../logs/README.md)) | Only credential redaction |
  21: 
  22: Git-ignored local folders used by the scripts: `models/` (GGUF and merged weights), `tools/` (llama.cpp,
  23: MobileWorld, Android SDK shims), `android_world/` (AndroidWorld clone), `.venv*`, raw MobileWorld trajectories.
  24: 
  25: ---
  26: 
  27: ## 2026-11-20 restructure
  28: 
  29: Goal: a layout a person can read. Nothing a reported number depends on was removed, and every analysis was re-run
  30: with identical output ([reproduce.md](reproduce.md)).
  31: 
  32: **Everything moved or removed is still in git** at tag `archive/pre-restructure-2026-11-20`, at its original path:
  33: 
  34: ```bash
  35: git show archive/pre-restructure-2026-11-20:scripts/local_sealed_aw.sh
  36: git ls-tree -r --name-only archive/pre-restructure-2026-11-20 logs/
  37: ```
  38: 
  39: Paths in `docs/PREREG_v4.md`, Codex reports and logs refer to the old layout. Use the tables below or the tag.
  40: 
  41: ### Moved
  42: 
  43: | Destination | What | Files |
  44: |---|---|---|
  45: | `analysis/` | Scripts that compute reported numbers | 11 |
  46: | `scripts/androidworld/` | AndroidWorld launchers, queues, re-runs, guards | 19 |
  47: | `scripts/mobileworld/` | MobileWorld VMs, watchers, model servers | 13 |
  48: | `scripts/training/` | Colab / Modal training and eval jobs | 32 |
  49: | `scripts/training/jobs/` | Job configs (`jobs/*.json`) | 30 |
  50: | `scripts/speed/` | CPU and phone speed benchmarks | 10 |
  51: | `scripts/publish/` | GGUF export, merge check, Hugging Face upload | 6 |
  52: | `docs/research/` | Research reports (from `reports/`) | 2 |
  53: | `docs/research/notes/` | Research notes (from `research_notes/`) | 11 |
  54: | `docs/` | History-rewrite record | 1 |
  55: 
  56: - Moved scripts had their internal paths, repository-root detection and process-matching patterns updated.
  57: - Local launchers now find the repository from their own location instead of a hard-coded path.
  58: - `scripts/androidworld/local_emu2_fill_v2.sh` was first removed, then restored: `local_v4_to_aw_v2.sh` depends on it
  59:   for the v4 hand-off. It now resumes through the bounded `local_sealed_aw_v3.sh`.
  60: 
  61: <details>
  62: <summary>Every moved file (old → new)</summary>
  63: 
  64: | Old path | New path |
  65: |---|---|
  66: | `scripts/bench_speed_report.py` | `analysis/bench_speed_report.py` |
  67: | `scripts/build_report.py` | `analysis/build_report.py` |
